{"id": "11", "model": "eleven_v4", "lines": [{"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "The next morning, everything is normal. [pause] Mostly."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "You still get picked last in gym. [pause] Except now Brick is team captain. [pause] And he picks you first."}, {"speaker": "DAD", "text": "[into the headset] Can you hear me now? [pause] ...I miss the sky office."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "Granny is still fast. She's never been late again. [pause] She also walks to the store... faster than the car."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "Zoe checks your monitor every day."}, {"speaker": "ZOE", "text": "[deadpan] Your password sticky note is still facing the window."}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[proud] Yeah. But now it says \"nice try.\""}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "And Pancake still sits on your keyboard. [pause] But now... when he does..."}, {"speaker": "SYSTEM", "text": "[calm] Command accepted."}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[whispers, horrified] ...PANCAKE."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "[deadpan] The panel didn't keep one command. [pause] It kept one admin."}], "voice_segments": [{"voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb", "start_time_seconds": 0.0, "end_time_seconds": 3.8400000000000003, "character_start_index": 0, "character_end_index": 55, "dialogue_input_index": 0}, {"voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb", "start_time_seconds": 3.8400000000000003, "end_time_seconds": 11.08, "character_start_index": 55, "character_end_index": 162, "dialogue_input_index": 1}, {"voice_id": "iP95p4xoKVk53GoZ742B", "start_time_seconds": 11.08, "end_time_seconds": 15.2, "character_start_index": 162, "character_end_index": 235, "dialogue_input_index": 2}, {"voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb", "start_time_seconds": 15.2, "end_time_seconds": 22.759999999999998, "character_start_index": 235, "character_end_index": 345, "dialogue_input_index": 3}, {"voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb", "start_time_seconds": 22.759999999999998, "end_time_seconds": 25.24, "characte